ion had blocked the path.\",\"before\":\"More perception would have prevented diversion.\"},\"confidence\":\"strong\",\"mechanism\":\"The closing counter-sequence joins strenuous exertion to gentle direction into plural paths. Against the focus sequence of insight plus blocked singular path, it makes committed movement the converter that turns discernment into guidance.\",\"model_id\":\"delta_effort_opens_paths\",\"reader_inference\":\"The packet supplies hardship-bearing effort, guidance, and plural roads; I infer that enacted commitment is the missing converter between insight and traversable guidance, while the live alternative is that singular and plural path forms are stylistic rather than contrastive.\",\"status\":\"revised\",\"structural_cues\":[\"The final ayah gives an explicit exertion-to-guidance relation.\",\"It repeats the focus path root in the plural after the focus's singular blocked path.\"],\"trigger_roots\":[\"ج ه د\",\"ه د ي\",\"س ب ل\"]}],\"focus_ref\":\"29:38\",\"protocol\":\"focus-trace-hermetic-response-v4\",\"reader_id\":\"reader_hft_a\",\"summary\":{\"remaining_uncertainties\":[\"مُسْتَبْصِرِينَ may denote moral discernment, worldly acumen, or both; the trace does not force one.\",\"The propagation from satanic beautification to social bonding and road-cutting is a reader-supplied causal arrow, though every stage is packet-anchored.\",\"The webbed-path and counted-ledger readings are branch resonances only and must not be rendered as lexical glosses.\"],\"strongest_changes\":[\"The focus shifts from ignorance to nonconversion: external evidence, heart-sight, internal signs, and correct speech can all coexist with diversion.\",\"Beautification operates through self-authored work, rival-path assurances, shared affection, public normalization, and the diverted person's own obstruction of others.\",\"Dwellings become both field evidence and failed security architecture, linking material remains to the later weak-house model.\",\"The surah suppl